# The Gateway's own store: sessions and the Super User's conversation transcript.
# Separate from the FI database by design (see gateway/store.py), and no more
# versionable - it is live local state, and its session rows are credentials.
gateway.db
gateway.db-wal
gateway.db-shm
# Simulation run output: one directory per run, each holding its own database
# and log. Reproducible from the scenario plus the manifest's recorded seed and
# code version, so the runs themselves are not worth versioning.
simulation/runs/
# Backup sets (backend/continuity.py): copies of the live stores above, and
# exactly as sensitive - gateway.db session rows and sessions.json are
# credentials in the backup too.
backups/
# The model-spend ledger (app/model_budget.py): live local state, one row per
# UTC day, shared by every process that calls the model.
model_spend.db
